sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant GUI
    participant System
    participant Database

    User ->> GUI: Open Composite Food Section
    User ->> GUI: Choose "Create New Composite Food"
    GUI ->> System: Show Food Creation Form
    User ->> GUI: Enter Ingredient Foods & Servings
    GUI ->> System: Validate Composite Food Data
    System ->> Database: Save Composite Food with User ID
    Database -->> System: Save Success
    System -->> GUI: Show "Composite Food Created"

    alt User Wants to Edit an Existing Composite Food
        User ->> GUI: Choose "Edit Composite Food"
        GUI ->> System: Request Ownership Validation
        System ->> Database: Check If User is Creator
        alt User is the Creator
            Database -->> System: Ownership Confirmed
            System ->> GUI: Allow Editing
            User ->> GUI: Modify Ingredients/Servings
            GUI ->> System: Validate & Save Changes
            System ->> Database: Update Composite Food Data
            Database -->> System: Update Success
            System -->> GUI: Show "Composite Food Updated"
        else User is NOT the Creator
            Database -->> System: Ownership Denied
            System -->> GUI: Show "Edit Not Allowed"
        end
    end

    alt User Wants to Delete Composite Food
        User ->> GUI: Choose "Delete Composite Food"
        GUI ->> System: Request Ownership Validation
        System ->> Database: Check If User is Creator
        alt User is the Creator
            Database -->> System: Ownership Confirmed
            System ->> Database: Delete Composite Food Entry
            Database -->> System: Deletion Success
            System -->> GUI: Show "Composite Food Deleted"
        else User is NOT the Creator
            Database -->> System: Ownership Denied
            System -->> GUI: Show "Delete Not Allowed"
        end
    end
